  progressInfos:
  - ProgressName: Welcome
    ProgressDescription: Welcome to The Magic Boat. This experience does not require
      a controller. Please make sure you put down your controller and see the hand
      outline with Hand Tracking.
    ProgressIndex: 0
    IsCompleted: 0
    RequireUIPanel: 1
    RequireAudio: 1
  - ProgressName: Ecosystem Tank Rotation
    ProgressDescription: This is an ecosystem tank. You can rotate it with one hand.
    ProgressIndex: 1
    IsCompleted: 0
    RequireUIPanel: 1
    RequireAudio: 1
  - ProgressName: Ecosystem Tank Scale
    ProgressDescription: You can change its size by using both of your hands
    ProgressIndex: 2
    IsCompleted: 0
    RequireUIPanel: 1
    RequireAudio: 1
  - ProgressName: The Boat
    ProgressDescription: You can find the boat in the right side of the Tank. You
      can grab it using your hand.
    ProgressIndex: 3
    IsCompleted: 0
    RequireUIPanel: 1
    RequireAudio: 1
  - ProgressName: Teleport Point
    ProgressDescription: After picking up the boat. You can find teleport point in
      the tank. Drop the boat to the teleport point by release your hand near by
      the teleport point.
    ProgressIndex: 4
    IsCompleted: 0
    RequireUIPanel: 1
    RequireAudio: 1
  - ProgressName: Teleport Stone
    ProgressDescription: Hover the teleport stone to start teleportation.
    ProgressIndex: 5
    IsCompleted: 0
    RequireUIPanel: 1
    RequireAudio: 1
